<title>USA: Smith buys Red Baron, sees boost to net.</title>
<headline>Smith buys Red Baron, sees boost to net.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith International Inc said Wednesday it has completed the acquisition of Red Baron (Oil Tools Rental) Ltd in a deal that is &quot;expected to have a positive impact on earnings and cash flow immediately.&quot;</p>
<p>The Red Baron, a oil and gas industry supplier, reported revenues of about $34.0 million in 1995 and will become part of the Smith Drilling &amp; Completions business unit, Smith said.</p>
